#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:5
#: fdaca61188694e4b865715c35fcd882f
msgid "PPM encoders"
msgstr "PPM 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:7
#: 38589fecb80b4905a0a30acd004d1ad2
msgid ""
"A `PPM Encoder <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=ppm+encoder>`__ will allow you to"
" use any older style RC receiver with only PWM outputs for each channel. "
"Several versions of the *3DR PPM-Sum encoder* are shown below:"
msgstr ""
"`PPM 编码器 <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=ppm+encoder>`__ 可让您使用任何仅有每通道 PWM 输出的旧式 "
"RC 接收机。以下展示了几个版本的 *3DR PPM-Sum 编码器*："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:13
#: 6965a964055e4b6b9dd9bbc3d100ddf4
msgid "Newest 3DR PPM-Sum encoder"
msgstr "最新款 3DR PPM-Sum 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:18
#: efe1eb9b28ca4f48a562e216dcd5e40c
msgid "Original 3DR PPM-Sumencoder"
msgstr "原版 3DR PPM-Sum 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:20
#: 96833d2459e54286aae0b6a72b6eaff0
msgid "There are some downsides of using this encoder:"
msgstr "使用此编码器存在一些不足之处："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:22
#: 874580cc4293476394bba968463669fa
msgid ""
"The PPM Encoder does require quite a bit of additional wiring to the "
"receiver."
msgstr "PPM 编码器需要与接收机之间进行大量额外接线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:23
#: d72b0aa3372c4b6cafcf98756e26661a
msgid ""
"It uses quite a bit of power making it likely you will need to plug in your "
"battery while doing radio setup with USB cable in Mission Planner."
msgstr "它耗电较多，因此在 Mission Planner 中通过 USB 线进行遥控校准时，可能需要同时接上电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:25
#: 1ff65b780feb4c3b8197f8df3d12983b
msgid "The encoder also costs as much or more than modern receivers"
msgstr "编码器的价格与现代接收机相当甚至更贵"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoders-new.rst:29
#: 55b744ca34054845ba3cfeda223fa8d7
msgid ""
"If you are using this PPM Encoder it is important to know that when you are "
"calibrating your transmitter you may need to hook up your flight battery to "
"the autopilot because the USB port alone can't supply enough power."
msgstr "如果使用此 PPM 编码器，需注意在校准遥控器时，可能需要将飞行电池连接到飞控，因为 USB 端口单独无法提供足够电源。"
